        content: `Test your acute/chronic and history-coding skills.`,
        question: "A patient presents with documented 'acute and chronic tonsillitis.' The Alphabetic Index shows separate subentries: 'Tonsillitis, acute (J03.90)' and 'Tonsillitis, chronic (J35.01)' at the same indentation level. How should this be coded?",
