      {
        type: "application",
        title: "On-the-Job Workflow",
        content: `**1. Read the op note title first.** "Arthroscopy with X" tells you it's surgical — go to the surgical code, skip 29870.\n\n**2. Confirm procedure depth.** Did the surgeon do meniscectomy, ligament repair, debridement, or just look? Each maps to its own code in **29871-29889**.\n\n**3. Lateralize.** Knee, shoulder, hip — add **-LT, -RT, or -50** as required by your payer. Bilateral TKAs are sometimes staged; verify each session.\n\n**4. For arthrocentesis, size first.** Small (finger/toe), intermediate (wrist/elbow/ankle/AC), or major (shoulder/hip/knee). Then ask: was **ultrasound guidance** used with a permanent image and report? If yes, jump to the **20604/20606/20611** family — never bill **76942** separately.\n\n**5. Watch the global period.** Major arthroplasty carries a **90-day global**; arthrocentesis has a **0-day global**. Post-op visits within the global window are not separately billable unless modifier **-79** (unrelated) applies.`,
        visual: {
          type: "diagram",
          svg: `<svg viewBox="0 0 1100 1100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="1100" height="1100" fill="#1a1a2e"/><text x="550" y="70" font-family="Arial" font-size="34" font-weight="bold" fill="#ffd700" text-anchor="middle">Coder Workflow: Joint Procedures</text><rect x="80" y="130" width="940" height="140" rx="16" fill="#6366f1" opacity="0.25" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="3"/><text x="120" y="175" font-family="Arial" font-size="26" font-weight="bold" fill="#6366f1">1</text><text x="170" y="175" font-family="Arial" font-size="20" font-weight="bold" fill="#ffffff">Read the op note title</text><text x="170" y="210" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" fill="#ffffff">"Arthroscopy WITH X" → surgical code only, never 29870.</text><text x="170" y="245" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" fill="#888">Title saves you 80% of the time.</text><rect x="80" y="290" width="940" height="140" rx="16" fill="#10b981" opacity="0.25" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="3"/><text x="120" y="335" font-family="Arial" font-size="26" font-weight="bold" fill="#10b981">2</text><text x="170" y="335" font-family="Arial" font-size="20" font-weight="bold" fill="#ffffff">Identify the specific procedure</text><text x="170" y="370" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" fill="#ffffff">Meniscectomy 29881/29880 · Ligament 29888 · Rotator cuff 29827</text><text x="170" y="405" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" fill="#888">Match the deepest work performed.</text><rect x="80" y="450" width="940" height="140" rx="16" fill="#f59e0b" opacity="0.25" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="3"/><text x="120" y="495" font-family="Arial" font-size="26" font-weight="bold" fill="#f59e0b">3</text><text x="170" y="495" font-family="Arial" font-size="20" font-weight="bold" fill="#ffffff">Lateralize and bilateral</text><text x="170" y="530" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" fill="#ffffff">-LT, -RT, or -50 for bilateral. Staged bilateral TKA → separate sessions.</text><text x="170" y="565" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" fill="#888">Confirm payer rules on bilateral.</text><rect x="80" y="610" width="940" height="140" rx="16" fill="#8b5cf6" opacity="0.25" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="3"/><text x="120" y="655" font-family="Arial" font-size="26" font-weight="bold" fill="#8b5cf6">4</text><text x="170" y="655" font-family="Arial" font-size="20" font-weight="bold" fill="#ffffff">Arthrocentesis: size → imaging</text><text x="170" y="690" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" fill="#ffffff">Small/Inter/Major → 20600/20605/20610; +US → 20604/20606/20611</text><text x="170" y="725" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" fill="#ef4444">NEVER bill 76942 with the +US codes.</text><rect x="80" y="770" width="940" height="140" rx="16" fill="#ec4899" opacity="0.25" stroke="#ec4899" stroke-width="3"/><text x="120" y="815" font-family="Arial" font-size="26" font-weight="bold" fill="#ec4899">5</text><text x="170" y="815" font-family="Arial" font-size="20" font-weight="bold" fill="#ffffff">Check the global period</text><text x="170" y="850" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" fill="#ffffff">TKA/THA = 90-day · arthroscopy = 90-day · arthrocentesis = 0-day</text><text x="170" y="885" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" fill="#888">Use -79 for unrelated procedures during the global window.</text><rect x="80" y="930" width="940" height="130" rx="16" fill="#0ea5e9" opacity="0.2" stroke="#0ea5e9" stroke-width="3"/><text x="550" y="975" font-family="Arial" font-size="22" font-weight="bold" fill="#0ea5e9" text-anchor="middle">Audit-Ready Checklist</text><text x="550" y="1010" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="middle">Op title ✓ · Specific procedure ✓ · Laterality ✓ · Imaging mod ✓ · Global modifier ✓</text><text x="550" y="1040" font-family="Arial" font-size="16" fill="#ffd700" text-anchor="middle">Hit all five, and your joint claims sail through.</text></svg>`,
          caption: "Five-step workflow for arthroscopy, arthroplasty, and arthrocentesis coding."
        }
      }
