        content: `Treat the Medicine section as a **lookup grid** organized by specialty. **Vaccines** → 2 codes always (admin + product). Counseling under 19? 90460/90461. Otherwise 90471/90472. **Psychiatry** → 90791 first visit, then time-based 90832/90834/90837. **Dialysis** → 90951-90963 monthly ESRD codes by age and visits. **Ophthalmology** → 92002/92012 new/established intermediate; 92004/92014 comprehensive. **Cardiovascular** → EKG 93000 global, 93005 tracing, 93010 read; cardiac rehab 93797/93798; stress test 93015. **Allergy** → testing 95004-95044 per test; immunotherapy 95115/95117. **Neurology** → EEG 95812-95822; NCS 95907-95913; sleep study 95810. **Infusion** → 96360 hydration, 96365 therapeutic, 96413 chemo (each with sequential add-ons). Memorize the **anchor code per specialty** and the rest flows from documentation cues. The Medicine section rewards pattern recognition more than memorization.`,
