        explanation: "**Each separately submitted specimen gets its own line at its own level.** Gallbladder = Level V (**88307**), skin tag = Level II (**88302**), incidental appendix = Level III (**88304**). Never lump containers together, and never use the same level for everything — the specimen drives the level.",
