        explanation: "When a patient is admitted AND discharged on the same calendar date, you use the consolidated same-day codes 99234-99236, NOT separate initial + discharge codes. Moderate MDM = 99235. Note also that observation codes 99218-99220 were RETIRED in 2023 — observation status now uses the same code family as inpatient (99221-99239).",
